  "releaseNotes": "- Add general information to bit field descriptions.\n      Usable for projects depending on Triamec.Tam.Core >= 15.0.0.\n      - Allow enumerating register composite array elements without casting.\n      - Restrict visibility of registers to Tria-Link or Tama interface. This is a braking change for the firmware build environment.\n      - Fail upon the attempt to declare a negative enumeration value within an unsigned enum.\n      - Reflect composite deprecation in the ESI macros.\n      - Fixes a defect leading to DeviceState and other common enumerations not being available in the project, leading to wrong code gen.",
